27
00:01:45,429 --> 00:01:50,243
COM AFETO, VAMOS FLORESCER!

28
00:01:50,271 --> 00:01:53,271
AGORA COMEÇA A JORNADA,

29
00:01:53,300 --> 00:01:58,486
COM HISTÓRIAS PRA INVENTAR…

30
00:01:58,514 --> 00:02:01,680
COM ESCUTA, ABRAÇO E ALEGRIA,

31
00:02:01,705 --> 00:02:07,486
PROFESSORA CLARA ENSINA A CUIDAR.

32
00:02:07,514 --> 00:02:11,386
NA FLORESTA ENCANTADA,

33
00:02:11,414 --> 00:02:15,614
APRENDEMOS COM O CORAÇÃO…

34
00:02:15,643 --> 00:02:19,414
